      "cwe_id": "CWE-862",
      "explanation": "The list_dids_extended function processes user-controlled filters. The code converts account and scope filters to internal representations, but there's a critical bug: line 109 assigns 'account' instead of 'scope'. More importantly, no ownership/authorization check is visible in this diff to verify that the caller has permission to query DIDs for the specified account/scope. The function appears to allow querying arbitrary scopes without access control verification.",
      "evidence": [
